                                "sense_id": "5cd95a69-bc4f-3b9d-94cb-956adf8e17e4",
                                "text": "Kernenergie is energie die vrijkomt met behulp van de brandstof uranium.",
                                "translation": "Nuclear energy is energy that gets released using the fuel uranium.",
